  apply (fire_of_run_instr tm Cc true true l B0_0RB0LC_1LA1RB_0RD1LA_1LC1RD p j [] []);
    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_0RB0LC_1LA1RB_0RD1LA_1LC1RD p j E)].
Qed.


(** ** Fires: every UNPINNED instruction fires from every anchor
