  | StC, S0 => mk S1 DL StD | StC, S1 => mk S1 DR StC
  | StD, S0 => mk S0 DR StC | StD, S1 => mk S0 DL StA end.

(** Its mirror 0LB0RC_1RA1LB_1RD1LC_0LC0RA: the same counter grown leftward.  Every
