Theorem nonhalt_0RB0LC_1LA1RB_1LD1RC_0RC0LA : NonHalt tm_0RB0LC_1LA1RB_1LD1RC_0RC0LA.
Proof. apply never_qh_tr_nonhalt, nqhtr_0RB0LC_1LA1RB_1LD1RC_0RC0LA. Qed.

