Lemma mirror_ok_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0LD1LA_0RA___ : mirror_tm tm_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0LD1LA_0RA___ = tmm_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0LD1LA_0RA___.
