             run_int_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0LD1LA_0RA___ (Ap_Alph_10_11_11 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j
             ltac:(discriminate) ltac:(reflexivity)).
  f_equal. exact (gei_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0LD1LA_0RA___ p j q0 E).
