  cden (Ap_Alph_011_111_1 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j P1_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_1LA0RC = Cc (Pos.succ p).
Proof.
  intros p j q0 E. destruct (Alph_011_111_1.cview_some_Alph_011_111_1 p (S j) q0 E) as (H1 & H2).
  unfold Cc_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_1LA0RC, cden, P0_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_1LA0RC, P1_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_1LA0RC; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
  unfold sden; cbn [s_pre s_u s_a s_b s_post].
  replace (1 * j + 0) with j by lia.
  split.
